I am trying to make a function that works like 'cut' , this is from base R as a workaround...looks correct to you?

cut <- function(x,cutpoints) {
    ret <- rep(1, length(x))

    for(i in cutpoints[-1]){
        i <- x > i
        ret[i] <- ret[i] + 1
    }

    ret

}

